  "title": "Zano Network Fees",
  "description": "Zano (ZANO) Network – Secure and Private Smart Contracts\nZano is a privacy-focused network that supports both public and private transacti...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ38VKSTFA74MX2GDZMMFJE\">Zano (ZANO) Network – Secure and Private Smart Contracts</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Zano is a privacy-focused network that supports both public and private transactions, with dynamic fees based on activity.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ38VKSHGYGE7QGRSZ9DJ79\">How Zano Fees Work</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Fees are based on:</p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Transaction size</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Private vs public transactions</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Network conditions</b><br>Fees are paid in <b>ZANO</b>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge estimates the right fee for each transaction type automatically.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ38VKSHMC26ATC28V2BDJZ\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – For faster transactions</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Balanced</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Cost-saving option</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Advanced manual fee setup</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ38VKSTN2JJ5NY12PAE9GM\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Typically <b>$0.01 to $0.05 USD</b> for most transactions.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ38VKSYYM199D2NPSCJTX4\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Zano lets you choose between open and private transactions at very low cost. Edge makes navigating fees simple so you can prioritize speed or savings easily.</p>",
